{"id":"word:hebrew:H7392","type":"word","title":"רָכַב","subtitle":"H7392 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"to ride (on an animal or in a vehicle); causatively, to place upon (for riding or generally), to despatch","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to רָכַב (H7392) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: v.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 78 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"רָכַב (râkab) means to ride (on an animal or in a vehicle); causatively, to place upon (for riding or generally), to despatch First listed occurrence: 1Chr 13 7."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"רָכַב","transliteration":"râkab","pronunciation":"raw-kab'","strong":"H7392","lemmaId":"hebrew:H7392","partOfSpeech":"v","forms":["רֹכֵ֣ב","רֹכְבֵ֤י","וְ/רֹכְב֖/וֹ","וַ/יִּרְכַּ֥ב","רֹכֵ֨ב"],"morphs":[["HVqrmpc",8],["HVqrmpa",7],["HC/Vhw3mp",6],["HVqrmsa",6],["HC/Vqw3ms",5],["HC/Vqrmsc/Sp3ms",5],["HC/Vhw3mp/Sp3ms",2],["HR/Vqc",2],["HVqrmsc",2],["HC/Vhw3ms",2]]},"definitions":{"short":"to ride (on an animal or in a vehicle); causatively, to place upon (for riding or generally), to despatch","usage":"bring (on (horse-) back), carry, get (oneself) up, on (horse-) back, put, (cause to, make to) ride (in a chariot, on, -r), set.","full":"H7392. rakab רָכַב verb mount and ride, ride (Late Hebrew = Biblical Hebrew; Assyrian rakâbu , Arabic Aramaic דְכֵיב , all id. ; compare Zinjirli רכב war-chariot , proper name, of divinity רכבאל (Cook 108 ); Sabean רכבהו = his rider Mordtm Him. Inschr.25 (of horse; but his trappings CIS iv, no. 306, 5 ); Ethiopic is attain, acquire ); — Qal Perfect 3masculine singular ׳ר Est 6:8 ; 2 masculine singular רָכַבְתָּ Num 22:30 ; 3 plural רָֽכְבוּ 1Sam 30:17 ; Imperfect 3masculine singular יִרְכַּב Lev 15:9 , etc.; Imperative masculine singular רְכַב Psa 45:5 ; Infinitive construct לִרְכֹּב 2Sam 16:2 ; 2Kin 4:24 ; Participle active רֹכֵב absolute Num 22:22 +, construct Amos 2:15 ; suffix רֹכְבוֺ Gen 49:17 +; feminine singular absolute רֹכֶ֫בֶת 1Sam 25:30 ; masculine plural רֹכְבִים Judg 10:4 +, etc.; — 1 mount, mount and sit , or ride , with עֵל of camel Gen 24:61 (J), 1Sam 30:17 , of ass ( חֲמוֺר ) 25:42 , 20 ; 2Sam 16:2 ( עַל object omitted), 19:27 ; 1Kin 13:13 , of mule ( מֶּרֶד ) 2Sam 13:29 ; absolute of mounting (and riding in) chariot 1Kin 18:45 ; 2Kin 9:16 . 2 ride, be riding c. עַל of mule ( מֶּרֶד ) 2Sam 18:9 , of ass, אָתוֺן Num 22:22 (J), so ( עַל object omitted) 2Kin 4:24 , of חֲמוֺר Zech 9:9 , of hose 1:8 ; with עַלאֶֿרְכָּב (see ׳מ ) Lev 15:9 ; with ב of animal ( בְּהֵמָה ) Neh 2:12 ; ב of chariotry and horses Jer 17:25 = 22:4 ; absolute (perhaps In chariot) Psa 45:5 ride on ! ride (habitually) with עַל of אָתוֺן Num 22:30 (J), of עֲיָרִים Judg 10:4 ; 12:14 , of סוּס Hosea 14:4 (figurative of alliance with Egypt), Jer 6:23 ; 50:42 ; Est 6:8 ; Hab 3:8 (figurative of ׳י ; possibly Add suffix reference to יָם , compare Deut 33:26 ), עַלקַֿל (|| סוּס ) Isa 30:16 ; of עַלכְּֿרוּב ׳י, 2Sam 22:11 = Psa 18:11 , קַל עַלעָֿב Isa 19:1 , with accusative שָׁמַיִם ride through Deut 33:26 , but also with ב location in, through , Psa 68:5 ; 68:34 . 3 participle רֹכֵב etc., as substantive, rider: אֲתֹנוֺת רֹכְבֵי Judg 5:10 ; ׳ר (ה)סוּס Amos 2:15 ; 2Kin 9:18-19 , Ezek 23:23 ; 38:15 ; Zech 10:5 , so (appositive מָּרָשִׁים ) Ezek 23:6 , 12 ; suffix of סוּס Gen 49:17 ; Exod 15:1 , 21 ; Jer 51:21 a Zech 12:4 ; Job 39:18 ; Hag 2:22 b; עַל of סוּס 2Kin 18:23 = Isa 36:8 ; רֶכֶשׁ רֹכְבֵי Est 8:10 , 14 ; suffix of chariot Jer 51:21 b Hag 2:22 . Hiph`il Perfect 2masculine singular הִרְכַּבְתָּ Psa 66:12 , etc.; Imperfect 3masculine singular וַיַדְכֵּב Gen 41:43 ; 2Kin 13:16 , suffix יַרְכִּבֵהוּ Deut 32:13 , etc.; imperative masculine singular הַרְכֵּב 2Kin 13:16 ; &#8212; 1 cause to (mount and) ride: with accusative of person + עַל of חֲמוֺר Exod 4:20 (J), of מִּרְדָּה 1Kin 1:33 , 38 , 44 , of סוּס Est 6:9 , cf. ( עַלסֿוּס omitted) 6:11 ; with accusative of person + ב of chariot Gen 41:43 (E), 2Kin 10:16 ; ב of chariot omitted 9:28 ; 23:30 = (with עַלרֶֿכֶב ) 2Chr 35:24 ; figurative Job 30:22 (that is, on the wind); with accusative of thing + אֶלעֲֿגָלָה 2Sam 6:3 = 1Chr 13:7 ; figurative, with accusative of person + עַל location ( ארץ עלבֿמותי ) Deut 32:13 so Isa 58:14 , + לְראֹשֵׁנוּ Psa 66:12 over our heads . 2 cause to draw (plough, etc.) Hosea 10:11 , object Ephraim Under figure of heifer. 3 figurative ( עַלהַֿקֶּשֶׁת ) יָָֽדְךָ הַרְכֵּב 2Kin 13:16 (twice in verse); cause hand to ride upon (grasp) bow .","rootNote":"a primitive root;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 13 7","keyReferences":["1Chr 13 7","1Kgs 1 33","1Kgs 1 38","1Kgs 1 44","1Kgs 13 13","1Kgs 18 45","1Sam 25 20","1Sam 25 42"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":78,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 13 7","book":"1Chr","chapter":13,"verse":7,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וַ/יַּרְכִּ֜יבוּ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Vhw3mp"},{"reference":"1Kgs 1 33","book":"1Kgs","chapter":1,"verse":33,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/הִרְכַּבְתֶּם֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Vhq2mp"},{"reference":"1Kgs 1 38","book":"1Kgs","chapter":1,"verse":38,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וַ/יַּרְכִּ֨בוּ֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Vhw3mp"},{"reference":"1Kgs 1 44","book":"1Kgs","chapter":1,"verse":44,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וַ/יַּרְכִּ֣בוּ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Vhw3mp"},{"reference":"1Kgs 13 13","book":"1Kgs","chapter":13,"verse":13,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וַ/יִּרְכַּ֖ב","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Vqw3ms"},{"reference":"1Kgs 18 45","book":"1Kgs","chapter":18,"verse":45,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וַ/יִּרְכַּ֥ב","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Vqw3ms"},{"reference":"1Sam 25 20","book":"1Sam","chapter":25,"verse":20,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"רֹכֶ֣בֶת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVqrfsa"},{"reference":"1Sam 25 42","